    <title>DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet - Releases - 2026-06-16</title>
    <id>https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet#2026-06-16</id>
    <link href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet" />
    <updated>2026-06-17T00:34:27Z</updated>
    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/releases/tag/v3.46.0"&gt;3.46.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Profiler] Improve native unwinding performance and memory consumption on ARM64&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Dynamic Instrumentation] Various performance improvements and bug fixes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Tracing] Fix OTLP traces being submitted to the wrong endpoint when an APM UDS socket is set&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance improvements and bug fixes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Tracer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set &lt;code&gt;TokenImpersonationLevel.Anonymous&lt;/code&gt; in &lt;code&gt;NamedPipeClient&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4501988599" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8676" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8676/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8676"&gt;#8676&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove libdatadog-based trace exporter (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4540812747" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8703" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8703/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8703"&gt;#8703&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use &lt;code&gt;TaskScheduler.Default&lt;/code&gt; when calling &lt;code&gt;Task.Factory.StartNew&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4639697883" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8779" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8779/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8779"&gt;#8779&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Continuous Profiler&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[Profiler] Try fixing crashes in etw events based profiler (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4494767558" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8673" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8673/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8673"&gt;#8673&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[crashtracker] Libdatadog provides OS info (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4502352068" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/8678" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8678/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/8678"&gt;#8678&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
